## 🚀 **Como Implementar**

### **1. Estrutura de Arquivos**
```bash
# Criar os diretórios
mkdir -p components/students/components
mkdir -p components/students/hooks  
mkdir -p components/students/steps

# Mover arquivos existentes
mv components/students/StudentFormCarousel.tsx components/students/
```

### **2. Instalar Dependências**
```bash
# Se necessário, instalar dependências de data
npm install date-fns
```

### **3. Atualizar Imports**
```tsx
// Substituir imports antigos
import StudentsPage from './page';

// Por imports modulares
import { StudentsListPage } from '@/components/students/StudentsListPage';
import { StudentFormCarousel } from '@/components/students/StudentFormCarousel';
```

### **4. Configurar Rotas**
```tsx
// app/(dashboard)/dashboard/students/page.tsx
export { default } from '@/components/students/StudentsListPage';

// app/(dashboard)/dashboard/students/new/page.tsx  
export { default } from '@/components/students/NewStudentPage';
```

---

